{"url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/2406770/","dev":"Reissad","pub":"Reissad","short":"Bodycam 是虛幻引擎 5 中第一款具有真實隨身攝影機視野的戰術多人 FPS。近距離戰鬥感覺原始而響亮。每個角度、標註和項目符號都很重要。在逼真的地圖上玩死亡競賽、團隊死亡競賽和僚機，其中團隊合作、戰術和關鍵技能是關鍵沒有準星、彈藥計數器或 HUD。團隊合作與戰術決策將決定勝負。每次交火都要求你保持冷靜、精準並迅速行動。沉浸在逼真的戰場中，與隊友配合完成任務。在瞬息萬變的戰局中，善用掩體、聆聽聲音並掌握每個關鍵時刻。","plat":["win"],"ws":false,"img":{"hero":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/0c4e1feab761f5add1505138b15c2e558bcaff34/library_hero.jpg?t=1794951323","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/677415ebaf02fc7ae5fe8960e6055e65e9fa21a4/header_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1794951323","wide":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/1aef76fd02bd126e5072d8eb162b780b1675ad48/capsule_616x353_alt_assets_4.jpg?t=1794951323","box":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/06a9a892984dab02424e2cd2c3a49fea6466c9be/library_capsule.jpg?t=1794951323","bg":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/dba61fbc3da9af203cc1c2bb2709c14bbb66a537/page_bg_v6.jpg?t=1794951323"},"shots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/5689aeb849dc9ed3d9b70ad1b830d0c94c143138/ss_5689aeb849dc9ed3d9b70ad1b830d0c94c143138.jpg?t=1794951323","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/ad5579da682b0f91c23a895b37089a24dda24258/ss_ad5579da682b0f91c23a895b37089a24dda24258.jpg?t=1794951323","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/dcf7dfe29365b0bf8e3e30798f7c8be5ac9a3ea2/ss_dcf7dfe29365b0bf8e3e30798f7c8be5ac9a3ea2.jpg?t=1794951323","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/926c3c136c80c1aaafc97b68a6bad427b61e127e/ss_926c3c136c80c1aaafc97b68a6bad427b61e127e.jpg?t=1794951323","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2406770/ed5ec44dde87f40b2d47e21f0600a8f786db985e/ss_ed5ec44dde87f40